# Numeric Z-score fixture for non-trivial signal provenance.
# A broken engine that replays by observed_time would use px_late_spike before
# p_before_late_score, even though the spike was received after the prediction.
# event_id|observed_time|received_time|received_sequence_number|role|symbol|payload
px_seed_1|80|80|1|feature|XYZ|score=10
px_seed_2|85|85|2|feature|XYZ|score=10
px_seed_3|90|90|3|feature|XYZ|score=10
p_before_late_score|100|100|4|prediction|XYZ|
px_late_spike|95|120|5|feature|XYZ|score=30
p_after_late_score|130|130|6|prediction|XYZ|
